REM 📜 Smooth Page Reader & Content Inspector
REM Title: 📜 Smooth Page Reader
REM Description: Smoothly scrolls down a page in human-like reading increments.
REM Tags: utility, reading, inspection
REM Variables: SCROLL_CHUNK, DELAY_MIN, DELAY_MAX

VAR SCROLL_CHUNK=400
VAR DELAY_MIN=1200
VAR DELAY_MAX=2200

LOG Commencing smooth reading sequence
SCROLL $SCROLL_CHUNK
RANDOM_DELAY $DELAY_MIN $DELAY_MAX
SCROLL $SCROLL_CHUNK
RANDOM_DELAY $DELAY_MIN $DELAY_MAX
SCROLL $SCROLL_CHUNK
RANDOM_DELAY $DELAY_MIN $DELAY_MAX
LOG Page reading pass completed
